er}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-13T01:19:50Z","updated_at":"2024-09-26T21:06:15Z","closed_at":"2024-09-26T21:06:15Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-10317](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-10317)\r\n### Description\n\nHighly suspect that commit 1215c3a71a0a6283d402f08645f8f096ab3bb0ce breaks gist index scan because it adds this logic\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n@@ -77,6 +77,12 @@ IndexOnlyNext(IndexOnlyScanState *node)\r\n                else if (ScanDirectionIsBackward(direction))\r\n                        direction = ForwardScanDirection;\r\n        }\r\n+       /* \"Don't care about order\" direction. */\r\n+       if (IsYugaByteEnabled() &&\r\n+               ScanDirectionIsNoMovement(((IndexOnlyScan *) node->ss.ps.plan)->indexorderdir))\r\n+       {\r\n+               direction = NoMovementScanDirection;\r\n+       }\r\n        scandesc = node->ioss_ScanDesc;\r\n        econtext = node->ss.ps.ps_ExprContext;\r\n        slot = node->ss.ss_ScanTupleSlot;\r\n```\r\n\r\nRepro script (taken from PG 15.2 point regress test):\r\n\r\n```sql\r\n-- Test that GiST indexes provide same behavior as sequential scan\r\nCREATE TEMP TABLE point_gist_tbl(f1 point);\r\nINSERT INTO point_gist_tbl SELECT '(0,0)' FROM generate_series(0,1000);\r\nCREATE INDEX point_gist_tbl_index ON point_gist_tbl USING gist (f1);\r\nINSERT INTO point_gist_tbl VALUES ('(0.0000009,0.0000009)');\r\nSET enable_seqscan TO true;\r\nSET enable_indexscan TO false;\r\nSET enable_bitmapscan TO false;\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM point_gist_tbl WHERE f1 ~= '(0.0000009,0.0000009)'::point;\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM point_gist_tbl WHERE f1 <@ '(0.0000009,0.0000009),(0.0000009,0.0000009)'::box;\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM point_gist_tbl WHERE f1 ~= '(0.0000018,0.0000018)'::point;\r\nSET enable_seqscan TO false;\r\nSET enable_indexscan TO true;\r\nSET enable_bitmapscan TO true;\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM point_gist_tbl WHERE f1 ~= '(0.0000009,0.0000009)'::point;\r\nSELECT COUNT(*) FROM point_gist_tbl WHERE f1 <@ '(0.0000009,0.0000009),(0.0000009,0.0000009)'::box;\r\n```\r\n\r\ngets\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR:  GiST only supports forward scan direction\r\n```\r\n\r\nfound in `gistget.c`\r\n\r\n```c\r\nbool\r\ngistgettuple(IndexScanDesc scan, ScanDirection dir)\r\n{\r\n    GISTScanOpaque so = (GISTScanOpaque) scan->opaque;\r\n\r\n    if (dir != ForwardScanDirection)\r\n        elog(ERROR, \"GiST only supports forward scan direction\");\r\n```\r\n\r\nAccording to debugger,\r\n\r\n```\r\n(gdb) p dir\r\n$2 = NoMovementScanDirection\r\n```\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-10317]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-10317?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"andrei-mart","id":1223507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart","html_url":"https://github.com/andrei-mart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrei-mart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/21435/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/21435/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}